        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jay Park\n- Organizations: 2PM\n- Products: Ultra Lover, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\", Go Crazy\n\nFacts:\n- Jay Park officially left 2PM in early 2010.\n- The live DVD 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\" documents 2PM's first Japan tour in 2011 at Makuhari Messe.\n- The single Ultra Lover was released along with 2PM's second live DVD, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\".\n- Go Crazy is the fourth Korean studio album and seventh overall album by South Korean boy band 2PM.",
